{%- comment -%}
  DRYE NT — Hide theme chrome on the nail-tech landing page
  --------------------------------------------------------------------
  Renders NOTHING visible. Emits only a <style> block that hides the
  DRYE header + announcement bar on THIS template only. Because this
  section's markup (the <style> below) is printed inside
  content_for_layout, it ships ONLY on pages that load
  templates/page.nail-tech.json — so it never leaks to the rest of
  the store. Keep it FIRST in that template's order.

  WHY: /pages/nail-tech is a paid-traffic conversion funnel. The
  global header (logo + About / How it works / Research / Field
  reports + cart) gives visitors exits out of the funnel before they
  reach the CTA. We strip the header so the only path forward is the
  page's own CTAs. The DRYE wordmark still shows inside the hero.

  SELECTORS ARE THEME-SPECIFIC — verified against this theme:
    • Header group section .......... sections/dryeNEW-header.liquid
        stable hooks: .dryeNEW-header-shell  /  [data-drye-header]
        (position:fixed, so removing it needs no padding fix)
    • Announcement bar .............. sections/drye-announcement-bar.liquid
        stable hook:  .dryeNEW-annbar-section
        (its inner .dryeNEW-annbar-spacer reserves the fixed stack's
         height; hiding the whole section reclaims that space)
  The #shopify-section-* ids below are the current header-group keys —
  belt-and-suspenders only. If the theme editor regenerates those keys,
  the class hooks above still do the job. Do NOT remove the `!important`.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  /* DRYE header (fixed) — stable class hooks + current group id */
  .dryeNEW-header-shell,
  [data-drye-header],
  #shopify-section-drye_new_header_gjmpwp,
  /* DRYE announcement bar (fixed + spacer) */
  .dryeNEW-annbar-section,
  #shopify-section-drye_announcement_bar_JtqhNN,
  /* mobile menu overlay, if ever opened */
  .dryeNEW-header__mob-overlay {
    display: none !important;
    visibility: hidden !important;
    height: 0 !important;
    max-height: 0 !important;
    overflow: hidden !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
  }

  /* No fixed header/announcement bar left to offset for. */
  body { padding-top: 0 !important; margin-top: 0 !important; }
  html { scroll-padding-top: 0 !important; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "DRYE NT — Hide chrome",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section-drye-nt-hide-chrome",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "DRYE NT — Hide chrome" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
